# Never auto-delete day cards

Hard rule for diana’s dashboard (`/Users/diana/my-dashboard`) everything page.

## Never

- Runtime scrub that `remove()`s `.day-block` nodes because they look “empty”
- `scrubEmptyDayCards` / `isDayCompletelyEmpty` boot that deletes past days
- Deleting day shells from `btm_day_shells_v1` as a cleanup pass
- Stripping baked day cards from `everything.html` without an explicit user ask to delete **that** day

## Empty days

If Diana wants empty past days gone, she must name it. Do not invent a background scrub.

## If days disappear from the rail

Disable the scrub immediately and hard-reload so baked days return. Do not ask permission.
